<section class="aub aub-band">
  <div class="aub-wrap aub-reframe__grid">
    <div class="aub-stack">
      <h2 class="aub-h2">Are you caring for your lengths, or your scalp?</h2>
      <p class="aub-lede">There's more hair in your brush than there used to be. In the bathroom mirror, your part looks a little wider. Most of us answer with a new shampoo and a mask for the lengths.</p>
      <p class="aub-lede">Your face gets a cleanser, an exfoliant and a serum. Your scalp is skin too, and it usually gets shampoo.</p>
      <p class="aub-reframe__close">That's why this routine starts at the scalp.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="aub-reframe__photo">
      <img src="{{ 'aubury-nettle.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1400" height="1856" loading="lazy" alt="Nettle leaves, one of the plants in both formulas">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

